sequenceDiagram
    participant Platform as Host Platform
    participant Agent as Agent Process<br/>(stdin/stdout)

    Note over Platform,Agent: NDJSON Protocol<br/>One JSON object per line<br/>Debug → stderr only

    Agent->>Platform: {"type": "ready"}
    Note right of Agent: Agent signals<br/>it's initialized

    Platform->>Agent: {"type": "message",<br/>"content": "Analyze this code",<br/>"message_id": "msg_001"}

    Agent->>Platform: {"type": "activity",<br/>"tool": "file_read",<br/>"description": "Reading main.py",<br/>"message_id": "msg_001"}
    Note right of Agent: Optional progress<br/>updates

    Agent->>Platform: {"type": "activity",<br/>"tool": "code_analysis",<br/>"description": "Analyzing patterns",<br/>"message_id": "msg_001"}

    Agent->>Platform: {"type": "response",<br/>"content": "Found 3 issues...",<br/>"message_id": "msg_001",<br/>"done": true}
    Note right of Agent: MUST end with<br/>done: true

    Platform->>Agent: {"type": "message",<br/>"content": "Fix issue #1",<br/>"message_id": "msg_002"}

    Agent->>Platform: {"type": "response",<br/>"content": "Fixed by changing...",<br/>"message_id": "msg_002",<br/>"done": true}

    Platform->>Agent: {"type": "shutdown"}
    Note right of Agent: Agent exits<br/>cleanly
